<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average rose 53.42 to 8,174.53, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite rose 2.50 points to 488.43, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share gained 23 cents.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 1,691 to 1,120.</p>
<p>Volume was 544,539,520 compared with 463,697,850 on Monday.</p>
